  "_note": [
    "Fixture data for the pack-migration doctor (scripts/lib/migration-doctor.mjs).",
    "Each home is a fake $COPILOT_HOME and each workspace a fake workspace root;",
    "workspace-doctor --self-test materializes them into a temp directory, runs the",
    "read-only report, asserts the verdict, and removes the temp tree. They are data,",
    "not committed directories, because a host cache tree ('installed-plugins/_direct')",
    "and an empty directory are both things a git checkout cannot reproduce faithfully.",
    "A file value that is an object is written as JSON; an array of lines is written",
    "verbatim, which is how the deliberately malformed files stay malformed; a key",
    "ending in '/' creates an empty directory."
